<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f6fb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; }
  .wrapper { max-width: 620px; margin: 24px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5eaf2; }
  .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #5b21b6); padding: 28px 32px; color: #ffffff; }
  .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
  .header p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #ece3ff; }
  .content { padding: 30px 32px; }
  .content p { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .notice { background: #fff7ed; border: 1px solid #fdba74; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 18px 0; color: #7c2d12; font-size: 14px; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; background: #7c3aed; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .link { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; word-break: break-all; }
  .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e8edf4; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Password Reset Requested</h1>
      <p>RentIt Portal Security Notification</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset your RentIt Portal password. Please complete the reset promptly so you can continue accessing your account.</p>
      <div class="notice">
        This reset link expires in <strong>24 hours</strong>. For security, please update your password as soon as possible.
      </div>
      <a class="btn" href="{!$Label.RentIt_portalURL}">Reset Password</a>
      <p class="link">Direct link: {!$Label.RentIt_portalURL}</p>
      <p>If you did not request this reset, you can safely ignore this email and no changes will be made.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      RentIt Property Management &bull; Automated email, please do not reply.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>